      "title": "Fry-Day Crispy Smashed Potatoes",
      "blurb": "Boiled soft, smashed flat, roasted until the edges shatter. Fries who?",
      "servings": 4,
      "prep": 10,
      "cook": 45,
      "heat": 0,
      "ingredients": [
        {
          "q": 2,
          "u": "lb",
          "i": "baby gold potatoes"
        },
        {
          "q": 1,
          "u": "tbsp",
          "i": "kosher salt, for the boiling water"
        },
        {
          "q": 3,
          "u": "tbsp",
          "i": "olive oil"
        },
        {
          "q": 2,
          "u": "tbsp",
          "i": "Roasted Potato blend",
          "blend": true
        },
        {
          "q": 2,
          "u": "tbsp",
          "i": "butter, melted"
        },
        {
          "q": 0.25,
          "u": "cup",
          "i": "grated parmesan"
        },
        {
          "q": 2,
          "u": "tbsp",
          "i": "chopped chives"
        },
        {
          "q": 0.5,
          "u": "cup",
          "i": "sour cream, for dipping"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "t": "Drop the potatoes into a pot of cold, salted water. Bring to a boil and cook until a fork slides right in.",
          "min": 18
        },
        {
          "t": "Drain and let them steam-dry in the colander while the oven heats to 450°F (230°C).",
          "min": 5
        },
        {
          "t": "Oil a sheet pan. Smash each potato to about ½ inch thick with the bottom of a glass."
        },
        {
          "t": "Drizzle with the olive oil and melted butter, then shower everything with Roasted Potato blend."
        },
        {
          "t": "Roast until the bottoms are deep golden, then flip and give them another 5–10 minutes.",
          "min": 25
        },
        {
          "t": "Hit them with parmesan, chives and one more pinch of blend. Dunk in sour cream."
        }
      ],
      "tip": "Let them steam-dry. Dry potatoes get crispy edges. Wet potatoes get sad."
    },
